","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,78,39,44,49,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003205","helmet":"WP1019905","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,78,39,44,49,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003205","helmet":"WP1019905","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,78,39,44,49,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003205","helmet":"WP1019905","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1014","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,78,39,44,49,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003205","helmet":"WP1019905","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10060","city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,78,39,44,49,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1003205","helmet":"WP1019905","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁绍麾下重要将领，以锐而轻敌的军事风格闻名。参与过征讨公孙瓒、平定青州黄巾军等战事。官渡之战中，袁绍命其率轻骑攻击曹操粮道，被曹仁击破于鸡洛山。后负责军粮护送，但因袁绍的细作被发现，使得运粮路线暴露，被徐晃等人火攻，韩猛被击溃，所运粮草被烧毁。韩猛也因此被袁绍撤去官职。","tc":"袁紹麾下重要將領，以銳而輕敵的軍事風格聞名。參與過征討公孫瓚、平定青州黃巾軍等戰事。官渡之戰中，袁紹命其率輕騎攻擊曹操糧道，被曹仁擊破于雞洛山。后負責軍糧護送，但因袁紹的細作被發現，使得運糧路線暴露，被徐晃等人火攻，韓猛被擊潰，所運糧草被燒毀。韓猛也因此被袁紹撤去官職。","en":"A prominent general under Yuan Shao, renowned for an aggressive yet reckless style of warfare. He took part in campaigns such as the expedition against Gongsun Zan and the pacification of the Yellow Turban rebels in Qing Province. During the Battle of Guandu, Yuan Shao ordered him to lead light cavalry to attack Cao Cao's supply lines, but he was routed by Cao Ren at Mount Jiluo. Later tasked with escorting supplies, his transport route was exposed when Yuan Shao's spy was caught. Attacked with fire by Xu Huang and others, Han Meng was routed and the grain wagons incinerated. Consequently, Yuan Shao stripped Han Meng of his rank.","jp":"袁紹配下の主要な将領の一人。「鋭にして敵を軽んず」と評される用兵の気風で知られた。公孫瓚討伐や青州黄巾軍の平定などの戦いに従軍した。官渡の戦いでは、袁紹の命を受けて軽騎を率いて曹操の糧道を攻撃したが、鶏洛山にて曹仁に撃破された。その後、兵糧の輸送警護を担当するも、袁紹の細作が捕らえられたことで輸送経路が露見し、徐晃らによる火攻めを受けて撃破され、輸送中の兵糧をすべて焼き払われた。韓猛はこの責を問われ、袁紹によって官職を剥奪された。","kr":"원소 휘하의 주요 장수로, 용맹하나 적을 얕보는 군풍으로 이름을 알렸습니다. 공손찬 토벌과 청주 황건적 평정 등 여러 전투에 참전했습니다. 관도대전 당시에는 원소의 명을 받아 경기병을 이끌고 조조의 군량로를 공격했으나 계락산에서 조인에게 격파당했습니다. 이후 군량 호송을 맡았으나, 원소의 세작이 발각되어 운송로가 노출되는 바람에 서황 등에게 화공을 당해 패주하고 수송 중이던 군량마저 전부 불타 버렸습니다. 한맹은 이 일로 원소에게 관직을 박탈당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10511","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"猛","nameTc":"猛","nameEn":"Meng","nameJp":"猛","nameKr":"맹","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"韩猛","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"197","city":"CS1014","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"78","wise":"39","politics":"44","charm":"49","will":"62","ruleTalent":"8","forceTal